Z||000005||Indiana_resto_guy||08-17-2001||02:20 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by billfredmike24:<BR><B>Roger, if you look at the diagram it seems to me that it would be a ground.  Anyone know where i'm to splice this into??<BR>Thanks Mike</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>If you are looking at the gray wire top right, then it is NOT a ground wire but<BR>as Roger has pointed out it is for dimming the panel lights as it states on the top of the schamitic.<BR>If it is not hooked up the you would blow at least 1 fuse, that being the instrument lights.<BR>||||reg||1
